      "content": "idk it feels like more than just colors. like last night i saw a black sedan idling near the corner for like 20 mins, and then an hour later the mailman—who usually comes at 2—was at my door. it's like they're timing things. if this was some kind of social study or like, monitoring, what kind of things would they be looking for specifically? what would be the \"tell\" for someone being observed?",
